  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Micro Enterprise Alliance was formed, 1994, by stakeholders in the sector, who were seeking a forum for networking and a joint voice for advocacy. Its mission is to enhance capacity, efficiency and effectiveness of micro enterprise development agencies. An HIV/Aids Workplace Based Programme, with peer counsellors, has been developed to move MEA members from awareneness to implementation of programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
